@labor

- @only_15_wage_contracts: Mandate that all companies holding federal contracts pay workers a minimum of $15 an hour 
- @root: Go back to other options

@only_15_wage_contracts
subtitle: Mandate a $15/hour minimum wage for all federal contractors.
choose-if: executive_orders >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: You have no executive orders available right now.
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.executive_orders -= 1;
Q.progressive_dissent -= 3;
Q.socialist_dissent -= 3;
Q.healthcare_cost_progress += 3;
Q.nat_support.age.mid += 2;
Q.nat_support.inc.low += 2;
Q.nat_support.inc.high -= 1;
window.simulate_polling();
!}

WIP

@foreign_policy

- @delay_afganistan_withdraw: Delay the withdraw from Afganistan
- @cut_off_israel_weapons: Cut off arm shipments to Israel
- @cut_off_arabic_weapons: Cut off arm shipments to the Gulf states
- @root: Go back to other options

@delay_afganistan_withdraw
view-if: afgan_withdraw_month > 0
subtitle: We are currently due to withdraw from Afganistan in [+ afgan_withdraw_month +]. If we do not believe that we are adequately prepared for it, we can delay the operation by 4 months. [? if afgan_withdraws_delayed = 1: National security advisors are suggesting we delay the withdraw, stating that there is not enough time to effectively evacuate our troops, allies, and equipment with the current deadline. ?] [? if afgan_withdraws_delayed > 1: The American people, especially the left flank of our party, are getting impatient. ?] [? if afgan_withdraws_delayed > 2: We better have a good reason for delaying the withdraw once again, as the public pushback especially amongst our left flank will be rapid. We can only delay the withdraw one more time. ?] 
max-visits: 3
choose-if: executive_orders >= 1 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if executive_orders = 0: You have no executive orders available right now. ?]  
on-arrival: {!
Q.afgan_withdraw_month +=4
Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed +=1
Q.progressive_dissent += 3 * Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed;
Q.new_liberal_dissent +=2 * Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed;
Q.blue_dog_dissent +=1.5 * Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed;
Q.youth_loyalty -=2 * Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed;
Q.gop_hawk_vs_dove -=1 * Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed;
Q.nat_flat_buff -= 0.1 * Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed;
Q.bop_foreign += 2 * Q.afgan_withdraws_delayed;
window.simulate_polling();
!}

Fine. By cutting welfare, we have reduced dissent within the coalition.

@cut_off_israel_weapons
subtitle: The law makes it clear that U.S arms cannot be sold to nations which will use them to commit war crimes or human rights violations. [? if israel_hate = 0: Anti-Israel sentiment in the United States is currently very low, so this policy will not have the support of the public. ?] 
max-visits: 1
choose-if: executive_orders >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: You have no executive orders available right now.
